{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>His eyes darker than wine.</b> The fifth sign shall be that abundance will grow beyond the world's usual custom, as it says: יְהִי פִּסַּת בַּר בָּאָרֶץ בְּרֹאשׁ הָרִים יִרְעַשׁ כַּלְּבָנוֹן פִּרְיוֹ (Psalms 72:16). And as they said (Shabbat 30b): The land of Israel is destined to yield ready-made cakes and silk garments."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:19.214366225Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}